        "section": "agent-pipeline"
      },
      "text": "Old pieces still used: corpus DB for the article text · SPRING as a tool the agent calls once per sentence · Wikipedia/Wikidata for names (live,\nalways cached) · OpenRouter for the model. Settings are inherited, not retyped.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Old pieces still used: corpus DB for the article text · SPRING as a tool the agent calls once per sentence · Wikipedia/Wikidata for names (live,\nalways cached) · OpenRouter for the model. Settings are inherited, not retyped.",
