      "text": "EXAMPLE — one batch, paragraph 6 of 5772\n  \"The award was challenged under section 34 of the Act. The\n   Court held that ...\"            (unsplit, one string)\n\nsplit by the agent, then in one turn:\n  spring_parse(\"The award was challenged under ...\")\n  spring_parse(\"The Court held that ...\")\n  spring_parse(\"The award was set aside ...\")   (4 calls, parallel)\n\nback, once per call, no ids and no article facts:\n  (z1 / obligate-01 :ARG1 (z2 / award))  8 nodes, 14 edges\n  status valid · or SPRING's own error list\n\nthe agent never sees a corpus sentence id; the harness matches\nits sentences back to the corpus text when the answer arrives",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EXAMPLE — one batch, paragraph 6 of 5772\n  \"The award was challenged under section 34 of the Act. The\n   Court held that ...\"            (unsplit, one string)\n\nsplit by the agent, then in one turn:\n  spring_parse(\"The award was challenged under ...\")\n  spring_parse(\"The Court held that ...\")\n  spring_parse(\"The award was set aside ...\")   (4 calls, parallel)\n\nback, once per call, no ids and no article facts:\n  (z1 / obligate-01 :ARG1 (z2 / award))  8 nodes, 14 edges\n  status valid · or SPRING's own error list\n\nthe agent never sees a corpus sentence id; the harness matches\nits sentences back to the corpus text when the answer arrives",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
