      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "section": "agent-pipeline"
      },
      "text": "A short list of names the article has already made clear: full\nname, kind, aliases, and where it was found. It is rebuilt\nfrom accepted results and saved with the checkpoint, so a\nrestart keeps it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
