      "customData": {
        "section": "agent-pipeline"
      },
      "text": "python run.py --article 5772 --mock --build --example   (no key)\npython run.py --all --limit 500 --workers 8\npython run.py --all --workers 8 --shard 1/4\n\n3 articles, 3 workers -> 177 accepted, 2 rewrites\nrerun -> all 3 skipped, nothing repeated",
