      "customData": {
        "section": "agent-pipeline"
      },
      "text": "read from dataset_amr/pipeline.config.json when it exists\n  OpenRouter api_url + api_key + model\n  corpus DB      dataset_amr/data/legal.db\n  base graphs    dataset_amr/data/work/amr_spring.jsonl\n  wiki cache     agentic_dataset/data/agent/wiki_cache.sqlite\n\npriority\n  defaults < dataset_amr/pipeline.config.json < config.json\n           < environment < command line\n\nwork settings\n  batch size    8 sentences per model call\n  repair tries  2 per sentence, then reject\n\nrewrite on/off and which kinds\n  rewrite.enabled, rewrite.kinds\n  or --rewrite on|off, --rewrite-kinds statute,provision",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
