      },
      "text": "THE SENTENCE\n\"Act\" (3 characters, offsets 49-52)\n  -> \"Arbitration and Conciliation Act, 1996\" (40 characters)\n\nTHE GRAPH\nSPRING: law :name \"Act\" · section :mod 34\nagent:  statute :legal-name + :wiki\n        provision :legal-name \"section 34\" :legal-part-of\n        court -> gov-entity :legal-type \"court\"\n\nTHE MEMORY\n2 names -> 4 names",
