      },
      "text": "For instance, Part one of the\nIndian arbitration\nlegislation, i.e., the\nArbitration and Conciliation\nAct, 1996 (the ‘Act’) has\nseveral provisions enabling\nIndian courts to interfere.",
      "fontSize": 10,
