      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For instance, Part one of the\nIndian arbitration\nlegislation, i.e., the\nArbitration and Conciliation\nAct, 1996 (the ‘Act’) has\nseveral provisions enabling\nIndian courts to interfere.",
      "autoResize": true,
