      },
      "text": "Read across a row to compare one moment for all six sentences; read down a column to follow one sentence. 360450 is the column detailed above. 360439\nnever reaches a graph: it is rejected first, and the card below says why.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read across a row to compare one moment for all six sentences; read down a column to follow one sentence. 360450 is the column detailed above. 360439\nnever reaches a graph: it is rejected first, and the card below says why.",
